le pink cotton utility shirt, with two flap pockets on the chest secured by metallic buttons. The shirt's sleeves are rolled up to the middle of her forearms, revealing her slender arms, and the hem is tucked neatly into a high-waisted, A-line denim mini skirt of a matching tone. The skirt features a double row of metallic buttons along the front center and has subtly frayed edges, giving it a structured yet casual look that accentuates her waistline. She carries a crossbody canvas bag with a cream-white and black color-block design. The bag’s main body is made of cream-colored canvas, with black leather accents at the base and handle connections. A wide black strap crosses diagonally from her left shoulder to her right hip, with the bag naturally resting at her right side.\n\nThe background features an outdoor stone staircase scene. To the left, there are rough-textured, gray-brown stone steps with visible wear along the edges, while the right side showcases a gray brick wall with neatly aligned bricks and slightly weathered mortar, adding a sense of age and character. In the distant, blurred background, faint outlines of greenery and architectural forms can be seen. Natural daylight streams in from the upper right, casting bright yet soft illumination across the scene. The light creates distinct highlights and gentle shadows on her face and clothing, enhancing the textures of her outfit and the glow of her skin. The overall atmosphere is fresh and vibrant, evoking the carefree charm of a summer afternoon stroll through the streets."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 98, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [240.21852111816406, 201.6927947998047], "pos": [-839.2274169921875, -111.59581756591797], "id": 54, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&